# Nothing to fill in here — there's no cloud account, API key, or database
# URL for this app. The first time you run `npm run dev` / `npm run build`
# / `npm run start`, a SESSION_SECRET line gets added to .env.local for you
# automatically (it just has to stay the same on this computer so logins
# keep working across restarts).
#
# Optional: override where the SQLite database file is stored (defaults to
# ./data/shop-parts-tracker.db).
# DATA_DIR=./data
